<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Chopin returns five days after his 119th and last dose. He took every dose on his video calls, 56 in the intensive phase and 63 in the continuation phase, finishing in 17 weeks. The two-month culture grew nothing, so he has two consecutive negative cultures. The cold he had in June cleared within ten days. He has no cough, sputum, fever, night sweats, or blood, and he weighs 55.0 kg, 6.5 kg more than at diagnosis. He had no tendon pain or tingling at any point. Between the sick visit and today there was no clinic review; the health department nurse asked about symptoms and side effects on every video call. He is teaching his full schedule of fifteen students and has started practicing for a small recital. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Treatment</td><td>119 of 119 doses observed, completed in 17 weeks</td></tr><tr><td>Cultures</td><td>Third-week and two-month cultures negative</td></tr><tr><td>Weight</td><td>55.0 kg, up 6.5 kg since diagnosis</td></tr><tr><td>Work</td><td>Teaching fifteen students a week</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

