    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>No cough, sputum, hemoptysis, or breathlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever, night sweats, or weight loss</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>No tendon pain</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No numbness or tingling</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood good; PHQ-9 3; no thoughts of suicide or self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

